# Only send what the docs image build needs to the build context (allow
# list): the workspaces, the build scripts and the root manifests read by
# `turbo prune`. Everything else, such as `.env*` files with secrets, never
# reaches the image
*
!apps/
!packages/
!scripts/
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!turbo.json

# Exclude local files within the included paths: environment files (except
# examples), dependencies and build output (rebuilt in the image)
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.vercel
**/coverage
**/dist
**/out
